# The Irencrag's trigger is "Whenever a legendary creature you control enters": Ornithopter, which is not legendary, gives
# no trigger: nothing is put on the stack as it enters, and Bot1 is asked nothing (the refusal). Aunt May, legendary,
# does, and Bot1 declines the "you may": the permanent stays The Irencrag, an Artifact with no Equipment type, and on
# turn 3 it taps for {C} as before.

